instance. Wire a mockable `FlutterSecureStorage` wrapper into
`StorageService`; persist only the raw master-key bytes after a successful
unlock; attempt to restore it before `loadSessions` in startup; and clear the
same entry on every required invalidation path. Add tests proving the
cross-instance no-password startup, cache miss fallback, and each clear path.

